3.1. Taxonomical identity of the plant used as a so urce of the phytopharmaceutical drug giving botanic al name of 
genus, species and family, followed by the authorit y citation (taxonomist’s name who named the species ), the 
variety or the cultivar (if any) needs to be mentioned. 

